  "steps": [
    "Mix yogurt, besan, spices and add 300-400mp water and mix it until no lumps.",
    "In a pan, add ghee, the garlic, green and red chillies, methi dana, hing, jeera, mustard and curry leaves. Saute for 2-3 mins.",
    "Now add chopped methi and saute for 2 mins.",
    "Add the besan kadhi mix and let it boil on medium flame for 5 mins.",
    "Then add tour boiled kala chana and cook for 10-15 mins and add jaggery.",
    "Serve with hot rice and enjoy."
  ],
